  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mi>K</mi></math>&nbsp; decreases exponentially with <math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math>&nbsp;The first graph is correct.<br /><br />But temperature is given in&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;<br />So,&nbsp; <math><mi>K</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;at <math><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mi>C</mi></math>.<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math>&nbsp; For temperature between&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mi>C</mi></math>and <math><msup><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the graph will come like (II)"
  }
